# 📱 ContentPulse

ContentPulse is a Streamlit-based Social Media Content Analyzer that analyzes uploaded PDF content and provides insights to improve clarity, interaction, and audience appeal.

## 🌐 Live Application

https://contentpulse.streamlit.app/

## ✨ Features

- 📄 Upload PDF documents
- 🔍 Extract selectable text from PDFs using PyMuPDF
- 📊 Calculate word count
- 📝 Calculate average words per sentence
- 💬 Detect questions
- 🎯 Detect potential hook words
- 🏷️ Detect hashtags
- ⚡ Generate a ContentPulse engagement potential score
- 💡 Provide content improvement recommendations
- ⏳ Loading state during analysis
- 🛡️ Basic error handling

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- PyMuPDF
- Git
- GitHub

## 🚀 How to Run Locally

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/nandinidhaka2023-a11y/contentpulse.git
cd contentpulse